Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 07:06:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 08/12] qwen4exp MTP: draft vocabulary subset
 (MELD_DRAFT_VOCAB=<int32 token ids>)

The draft context copies the subset's rows of the LM head into a small head of its own once; when
backend sampling picks every draft output, the draft graph multiplies only those rows and the
sampled / candidate indices are mapped back to token ids with get_rows.
The list is raw int32 token ids. M2 Max, Q2_0-d8: draft step 3.51 -> 2.38 ms (106K tokens) /
1.91 ms (40K), acceptance unchanged; server+MTP decode ~+8..17%.
